# The Neighbourhood Builder — what git should NOT carry.
#
# 2026-09-04: this folder held the house builder (build-neighbourhood.py) and the
# service (neighbourhood-service.py) on ONE DISK with no history and no remote, while
# every other part of the project was in git. The code is small; the output is 5.5 GB.
# So: track the CODE, never the renders.

# Job output — 5.5 GB of candidate renders, briefs, logs and UPBGE consoles.
# Regenerable by definition: every one of these is a build the service can run again.
jobs/

# Loose renders and captures left beside the scripts
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.hdr
*.glb
*.blend
*.blend1

# Python and editor noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# The service's own rolling log
service-log.txt
*-console.txt
